        <read>status</read>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Readiness for data point queries: <computeroutput>Ready</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>Idle</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>Preparing</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>Unsupported</computeroutput>, or <computeroutput>Unavailable</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Bar, rectangle, band, and heatmap series are <computeroutput>Ready</computeroutput> while available; the queries that do not apply to them return <computeroutput>Unsupported</computeroutput>. <computeroutput>Unsupported</computeroutput> only for a series that answers no query. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
